{"4387550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "International Waters", "steam_appid": 4387550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4387550/extras/2c3d6d88222a474ffe35fcf13a6a2c2e.avif?t=1776730758\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4387550/extras_big/2c3d6d88222a474ffe35fcf13a6a2c2e.avif?t=1776730758 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >International Waters is a solo-developed platformer where you jump around and fight bosses. I'm not sure how to describe it but its fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 3D world which you drive around an open sea by boat to explore and find levels. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D platforming levels that you play and try to beat and progress through the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+  platforming levels. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack of 30+ songs in the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original animations, art, 3D assets sound effects, and textures. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Simple mechanics: Move, Jump, Shoot, Blink and Parry. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 boss fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive a boat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit on a bus</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Entering The World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive around in a boat and discover the secrets of an absurd world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your two buds go on a voyage deep at sea until you find a massive island. As you go around this island, you learn more about what this island is and where it came from, and the monster behind it all.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4387550/extras/2c3d6d88222a474ffe35fcf13a6a2c2e.avif?t=1776730758\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4387550/extras_big/2c3d6d88222a474ffe35fcf13a6a2c2e.avif?t=1776730758 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >International Waters is a solo-developed platformer where you jump around and fight bosses. I'm not sure how to describe it but its fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 3D world which you drive around an open sea by boat to explore and find levels. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D platforming levels that you play and try to beat and progress through the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+  platforming levels. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack of 30+ songs in the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original animations, art, 3D assets sound effects, and textures. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Simple mechanics: Move, Jump, Shoot, Blink and Parry. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 boss fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive a boat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit on a bus</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Entering The World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive around in a boat and discover the secrets of an absurd world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your two buds go on a voyage deep at sea until you find a massive island. As you go around this island, you learn more about what this island is and where it came from, and the monster behind it all.</p>", "short_description": "Lost at sea, you and your two buds discover a mysterious island. Progress through platformer levels, fight bosses, and learn about the dark truth of the island and the monster behind it all.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4387550/d4b97de15704afa7384e5c35602d74a677398c6d/header.jpg?t=1776730758", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4387550/6df18e80968a0005a53efd955fb2812398b11eb8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776730758", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4387550/6df18e80968a0005a53efd955fb2812398b11eb8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776730758", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 2.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 8 GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 8 GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimu